    <!-- ==================== FOOTER ==================== -->`,schemas:[]},{slug:"herringbone-geometric-led-mirrors-sialkot",title:"Herringbone Pattern LED Mirrors Sialkot | Rahman",metaDesc:"Herringbone and geometric pattern LED mirrors in Sialkot by Rahman. Precision braided border lighting, touch dimmers, and custom sizing.",canonical:"https://mirror-design.vercel.app/blog/herringbone-geometric-led-mirrors-sialkot",ogImage:"https:https://mirror-design.vercel.app/images/herringbone-braided-led-mirror-sialkot.webp",waUrl:"https://wa.me/923021054485?text=Hello%20Rahman%2C%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20a%20Custom%20Herringbone%20%2F%20Geometric%20LED%20Mirror%20in%20Sialkot.%20Please%20share%20sizes%20and%20pricing.",isWorkshopAnnouncement:!1,hasSearch:!0,bodyHtml:`<!-- ==================== ARTICLE HERO ==================== -->\r
